Description: Control Center for Clevo laptops
 Unofficial Linux port of the Clevo Control Center 3.0 suite: fan monitoring
 and fan curves, performance modes and keyboard backlight control.
 .
 Contains the ripple_dchu kernel module (built with DKMS), the ripple-ccd
 hardware service, the ripplectl command line tool and the graphical apps.
